    <string name="about_prayer_texts">Prayer Texts</string>
    <!-- The Vicariate line is a provisional attribution of fact, pending the exact
         wording Fr. Piotr sends; replace it verbatim then, as the Exarchate's was. -->
    <string name="about_prayer_texts_body">The Divine Mercy Chaplet in Hebrew is the Latin Patriarchate of Jerusalem’s own text, approved by Patriarch Michel Sabbah in 2003. Some of the prayers in Hebrew and Aramaic are used with the permission of the Patriarchal Exarch of the Aramaic (Syriac) Catholic community. The Hebrew prayers are the Saint James Vicariate for Hebrew Speaking Catholics’ own texts, from their prayer book.</string>
